   - **Position 3 (Shubh Gems - 4,554 words, 25 H2s)**: Comprehensive gemstone authority page detailing natural vs synthetic Panna, origins, astrological benefits (Mercury, intellect, speech, commerce), carat/ratti calculations, purification rituals (Panchamrit, Gangajal, Budha mantra), and BIS/laboratory certificates.
   - **Position 4 (GemsRoot - 5,519 words, 44 H2s)**: Deep buying guide covering 4Cs of emeralds (color dominance 50-70%, clarity inclusions/jardin, cut), origin comparison (Colombian vs Zambian vs Brazilian), who should wear (horoscope, zodiac ascendants Gemini/Virgo), wearing procedure, lab certification (GIA, IGI), and daily care.
